{"id":"j9rhcb5zp78ibb725kthkukvh","title":"如何确定药物靶点？从多组学发现到实验验证","originalTitle":null,"summary":"药物研发中，确定靶点需回答三个关键问题：是否驱动疾病、干预能否改善疾病、干预是否安全。多组学、细胞实验和动物实验分别提供不同层次的证据，确保靶点的有效性和安全性。最终，兼具疾病相关性、可干预性和安全性的靶点才值得推进。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3662723&do=blog&id=1560773"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T01:17:20.563Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T01:17:20.563Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["论文发表"],"score":24,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}